{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Localization</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is fully localized in <strong>English and Turkish</strong>, so players can enjoy the story and atmosphere in their preferred language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016620/extras/9aa6f350863e6a1871c5f064407dc34a.poster.avif?t=1757741619\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016620/extras/9aa6f350863e6a1871c5f064407dc34a.webp?t=1757741619\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=633 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Credits Section</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All objects, assets, and inspirations used in <strong>Vesper Hotel</strong> that require attribution are listed on our external attribution page, which can be accessed via the Privacy Policy section. This page provides proper credits for all referenced materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where fear and mystery intertwine. <strong>Vesper Hotel</strong> invites you to explore haunted corridors, forsaken rooms, and environments heavy with the weight of a dark past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner holds a secret, every door hides a story. Sometimes your only companion will be a fragile source of light \u2014 other times, your greatest enemy will be your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Horror</strong>: Experience every chase and encounter through the eyes of your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong>: Uncover the hotel\u2019s secrets through notes, reports, and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension</strong>: Face not only what lurks in the shadows, but also the fears within yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Indie Spirit</strong>: A handcrafted horror experience developed entirely by a solo creator.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016620?t=1757741619","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016620?t=1757741619","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016620/37edc823bbbf91851df82dbfbd1535e6a21f0a05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757741619","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016620/37edc823bbbf91851df82dbfbd1535e6a21f0a05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757741619","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Localization</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is fully localized in <strong>English and Turkish</strong>, so players can enjoy the story and atmosphere in their preferred language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016620/extras/9aa6f350863e6a1871c5f064407dc34a.poster.avif?t=1757741619\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016620/extras/9aa6f350863e6a1871c5f064407dc34a.webp?t=1757741619\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=633 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Credits Section</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All objects, assets, and inspirations used in <strong>Vesper Hotel</strong> that require attribution are listed on our extern